B.ZI=new A.ar("feature_sleep","Sleep","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha. On success target up to {Source} enemies range 6, and knock them prone and asleep. On the start of their turn, make a status check vs Wis. On success, they are stunned and remain asleep. Otherwise the effect ends for the target and they take their turn as normal. When sleeping, if an enemy is attacked or takes damage they wake up and the effect ends. An ally can spend an [Action] or [Reaction] to wake an ally.\n\n[Reaction] when an enemy is knocked prone, spend your reaction and make a status check vs Cha. On success, put the target and all prone enemies to sleep. If it is the target's turn, immediately make the status check as if it was the start of their turn.",B.N,B.ae2,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Ud=new A.v("feature_silence_voice_thief","Voice Thief","While Concentrating, Enemies range {Source} of you who are allies with one of the targets are creeped out by you using their voice. While in range, you and your allies gain a +1 to Int, Wis, Cha attack results against those enemies and +1 to Int, Wis, Cha Defense results from attacks caused by the enemies.")
B.Vm=new A.v("feature_silence_sore_throat","Sore Throat","While concentrating, At the Start of your turn, gain 1d6 Sore Throat dice then roll your sore throat dice dealing that much damage to all targets. You may gain a max of {Source} sore throat dice.")
