B.Zi=new A.ar("feature_silence","Silence","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting Enemies in a {Half Source} space radius range 6/12. On Success, the targets are Silenced for as long as you remain concentrating. While silenced, they may not activate combat features, but can otherwise take their turn. If player characters gain this effect they cannot speak and must mime. If playing over voice only, they may only make noises. Chumps cannot trigger their chump actions.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack, spend your reaction and start concentrating on silence targeting the triggering attack\u2019s targets. ",B.N,B.aes,!1,!0,null,null)
B.XN=new A.v("feature_spirit_disruptive_spirit","Disruptive Spirit","Spaces adjacent to your spirit are difficult terrain for enemies. You and your allies have a +1 to attacks and status checks against enemies adjacent to your spirit. This doesn't include your spirit attacks. ")
