B.Zd=new A.ar("feature_spirit","Spirit","[Action] Target an unoccupied square within 6 spaces, and summon your Spirit. As long as you remain concentrating, When you use the ability and as a [Reaction] on following turns, you may move your spirit Companion up to 6 spaces ignoring Difficult terrain, and make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting enemies range 1. On Success Deal {Source d10} Damage ignoring shields and resistance. \n\nYour Spirit can be anything as long but takes up the space of a medium creature. It uses your defenses when attacked, and you take half of all damage that would be dealt to the spirit. This damage cannot be reduced in any way. You do not make concentration checks from damage to your companion. Allies and the spirit may flank.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction and summon your spirit in an unoccupied space within 6\n",B.N,B.abO,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Uu=new A.v("feature_stance_crane","Crane","When you are targeted by a Melee attack and are not prone, You may make an attack instead of a defense. On success, Deal {Half Source d6} Damage and the attack misses as normal. On failure, you fall prone and the attack succeeds against you")
B.Tv=new A.v("feature_stance_dog","Dog","While prone, melee attacks do not have advantage against you and you don\u2019t have disadvantage making melee attacks. When you succeed on a melee attack using your action when prone, deal {Half Source d6} Extra damage.")
