B.ZH=new A.ar("feature_tribal_gatherer","Tribal Gatherer","Coordinated Movement [Reaction]: When you or an ally you can see Uses [Run], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to their speed.\n\nCoordinated Retreat: [Reaction] When you or an ally you can see Uses [Retreat], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to half their speed without provoking.\n\nCoordinated Work [Reaction]: When an ally range {Source} uses an action to make a skill check, you may spend your reaction, to give them 1 reroll and 1 additional reroll per ally within {Half Source} of the target. These rerolls can only be used on that specific skill and last until the end of the situation.\n",B.aC,B.abu,!1,!0,null,null)
B.UB=new A.v("feature_tribal_hunter_Packhunter","Packhunter","Until the start of your next turn, allies who attack targeted enemies increase their damage by {Half Source d6}.")
B.WO=new A.v("feature_tribal_hunter_Leader_of_the_Hunt","Leader of the Hunt","After Coordinated Strike or Joint Strike, Until the start of your next turn, allies within {source} spaces of you have +1 to attack results.")
B.UG=new A.v("feature_tribal_hunter_Gather_and_Prepare","Gather and Prepare","[Action] You and all Allies range {source} may move up to {source} spaces, then may make a conceal check to hide. Until the end of your next turn, you and your allies have a +1 to Coordinated Strike attack results.")
B.aea=s([B.UB,B.WO,B.UG],t.U)
B.a_C=new A.ar("feature_tribal_hunter","Tribal Hunter","Coordinated Strike [Action]: You and {Source/3} allies range 6 make either a Ranged Attack vs Dex Range 6 or Melee Attack vs Str range 1 targeting one enemy, on success deal {Source d6} damage for Ranged, and {Source d8} for melee. Each attacker chooses range or melee individually.\n\nJoint Strike [Reaction] Before an Ally you can see makes an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and give the ally a +1 to the attack result. If they succeed, If the attack was Melee, target an enemy range 1, and deal {Source d8} damage vs Str, if the attack was Ranged, target an enemy range 6 and deal {Source d6} damage vs Dex.",B.N,B.aea,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Wh=new A.v("feature_upgrade_armor_Self_Walking_Legs","Self Walking Legs"," At the start of your turn, You may force targets to move {Source}.")
B.T5=new A.v("feature_upgrade_armor_Drone_Delivered","Drone Delivered","You may target Creatures range {2 * Source} and when you use the feature, you may force them to move to a free space range {Source}.")
B.Wr=new A.v("feature_upgrade_armor_Power_Armor","Power Armor","While concentrating, Each round, the target may gain resistance to the damage from an attack up to {Half Source} times.")
B.aco=s([B.Wh,B.T5,B.Wr],t.U)
B.ZB=new A.ar("feature_upgrade_armor","Upgrade Armor","[Reaction] During your turn or when an ally becomes adjacent to you, Spend your reaction and Target {Half Source} creature without upgraded armor range 1. As long as you remain concentrating, they gain a +1 bonus to defense results. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] Start of a Combat Situation when you were not surprised, you may spend your reaction and give up to {Half Source} Creatures on your team your upgraded armor, and you begin concentrating on your upgraded armor. You do not regain your reaction on your first turn.\n",B.aC,B.aco,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Tc=new A.v("feature_upgrade_attacks_Extender","Extender","Increase the target's attack range by {Half Source}.")
B.XM=new A.v("feature_upgrade_attacks_Magical","Magical","The targets may choose to have their attacks target Int, Wis, or Cha defense instead. If they do, they deal 1d12 extra damage.")
B.aaI=s([B.Tc,B.XM],t.U)
B.Za=new A.ar("feature_upgrade_attacks","Upgrade Attacks","[Reaction] During your turn or when an ally becomes adjacent to you, Spend your reaction and Target {Half Source} creatures with unupgraded attacks Range 1. As long as you remain concentrating, they gain a +1 to attack results and deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on success. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] Start of a Combat Situation when you were not surprised, you may spend your reaction and give up to {Half Source} Creatures on your team your Attack upgrade, and you begin concentrating on your upgraded attacks. You do not regain your reaction on your first turn.\n",B.aC,B.aaI,!1,!0,null,null)
B.UM=new A.v("feature_vow_My_Valor","My Valor","While concentrating, If the target is within {Source} of you, they have +1 to attack results.")
B.Y4=new A.v("feature_vow_Shared_My_Blood","My Blood","While concentrating, At the start of your turn or when you take your vow, you may gain up to {Source} d6 bleed. As long as you have this bleed, your vow target has the same amount of regeneration. Damage from this bleed doesn\u2019t require you to make concentration checks.")
B.YQ=new A.v("feature_vow_My_Vengeance","My Vengeance","While Concentrating, you deal {Source/3} d8 bonus damage to any enemy that has damaged the target of your vow in this situation.")
B.Ts=new A.v("feature_vow_My_Friends","My Friends","You may target any number of your allies.")
B.TR=new A.v("feature_vow_My_Heart","My Heart","While concentrating, you give half of the healing and shield you receive to your vow target, reducing your healing and shield by the same amount. If you or your vow target die, the other must make a Will Defense, On Success they take {Half Vitality d12} damage. On Problems, they take {Vitality d12} damage.")
B.abE=s([B.UM,B.Y4,B.YQ,B.Ts,B.TR],t.U)
B.a_t=new A.ar("feature_vow","Vow","[Reaction] During your Turn, or Start of the Encounter, target 1 of your allies and begin concentrating on your vow. While concentrating, the target has resistance to all damage and you take an equal amount of damage whenever they take damage. Damage from your vow doesn\u2019t require you to make concentration checks. \n\n[Action] Target 1 of your allies and begin concentrating on your vow.\n",B.aC,B.abE,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Uf=new A.v("feature_wall_of_shields_Champion","Champion","You automatically succeed on concentration checks caused by attacks against your allies and you gain resistance to damage from attacks that targeted your allies.")
B.Tp=new A.v("feature_wall_of_shields_Empowered","Empowered","You and your allies adjacent to the wall gain {Half Source} bonus range on attacks.")
B.T9=new A.v("feature_wall_of_shields_Tactician","Tactician","While Concentrating, [Reaction] During your turn, You may move {Source} spaces then reshape your wall.")
B.acj=s([B.Uf,B.Tp,B.T9],t.U)
B.a_n=new A.ar("feature_wall_of_shields","Wall of Shields","[Action] Summon {Source} spaces worth of shield walls in free spaces that are connected to your space. The walls last as long as you remain concentrating. Characters cannot move through the walls but may dash over. Whenever your wall is attacked, you are attacked instead. When a character targets an ally on the other side of the wall or the ally is adjacent to the wall, you may have the attack instead target your wall. While concentrating, you are restrained and at the end of your turn you gain {Source d6} shield.\n\n[Reaction] During your or a willing ally's turn, spend your reaction. Perform your shield wall using the triggering ally instead of yourself. You concentrate on the wall instead of the target. The target may stop the wall at any time.",B.aC,B.acj,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Vb=new A.v("feature_ward_Banish","Banish","Whenever you succeed a Ward Status Check, you also push enemies adjacent to you {Half Source} spaces away from you.")
B.U9=new A.v("feature_ward_Enchant","Enchant","You may force the targets to move {Source} spaces instead of pushing them. Including from Banish.")
