B.abR=s([B.Vb,B.U9,B.Xp],t.U)
B.a_r=new A.ar("feature_ward","Ward","[Action] Target yourself or an Ally range 4 and begin concentrating. While concentrating, at the start of the target\u2019s turn make a Status Check vs Wis. On Success, the target gains {Source d6} shield, and push all enemies adjacent to the target {half Source} spaces away from the target.\n\n[Reaction] At the start of your or an ally\u2019s turn, Make a status check vs Wis. On Success, give the Target {Source d6} shield, and push enemies adjacent to the target {half Source} Spaces away from the target.\n",B.aC,B.abR,!1,!0,null,null)
