B.Q_=new A.bS("melee_valorous","Valorous","On Player Failure, this chump resists all damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range {Level} is successfully attacked and that attack didn't include this chump as a target, this chump takes the damage instead of the target. Effects still target the original character.",B.c1,B.cZ)
