B.aAV=new A.bP("weapon_ranged_Catapult","Catapult",B.bb,"Target creatures in a 1 space radius. [Reaction] During yours or allies turns, Launch a willing adjacent creature to a free space within {Source}.","6 / 12","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aAT=new A.bP("weapon_ranged_Cannon","Cannon",B.bb,"On Success, you and your allies deal {Half Source d6} bonus damage on Attacks that target Str or Vitality until the end of your next turn.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
